278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 256 0 R
/T (To say that I am humbled and overcome with your love and support and confidence would be a understatement of the sentiment I feel today. As I was going through the onboarding packet that Mayor Fullmer made for me. There was a lot in there. And there was a lot in there that made me pause and think about the confidence and the trust that communities placed in me, and I, from the bottom of my heart, I say thank you. I think as well, any speech or talk without giving due to gratitude to my wife. We started 14 years ago when my dad first ran for the House of Representatives.)
/E (To say that I am humbled and overcome with your love and support and confidence would be a understatement of the sentiment I feel today. As I was going through the onboarding packet that Mayor Fullmer made for me. There was a lot in there. And there was a lot in there that made me pause and think about the confidence and the trust that communities placed in me, and I, from the bottom of my heart, I say thank you. I think as well, any speech or talk without giving due to gratitude to my wife. We started 14 years ago when my dad first ran for the House of Representatives.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [5]
>>
