/T (Over the last month or so, since I was declared the winner, we've really been hard at work and I just want to tell you how grateful I am to be working alongside this amazing council. These are men of integrity, men of rectitude, men who are willing to do the hard thing rather than the easy thing, and my commitment to you and to Vineyard is that we will do all we can to be transparent, to respect your hard-earned dollars, and ensure that we do the will of people.)
